  "sangamTamil": "பெரியார் பெருமை சிறுதகைமை ஒன்றிற்\nகுரியா ருரிமை யடக்கம் - தெரியுங்கால்\nசெல்வ முடையாருஞ் செல்வரே தற்சேர்ந்தார்\nஅல்லல் களைப வெனின்.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "Humility. Self-restraint. Charity. The greatness of the great is [the quality of littleness (in their own sight), i. e.] humility; the (real) acquisition of those who have acquired (any). one (science) is modest self-restraint. If you rightly understand things, those possessors of wealth only are really wealthy who relieve the wants of those that approach them (as suppliants).",
